{"name":"Wizard","hex":"#4d5b88","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"wizard","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Someone, usually male, who uses (or has skill with) magic, mystic items, and magical and mystical practices.","One who is especially skilled or unusually talented in a particular field."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Fine, superb (originally RAF slang)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/wizard"}],"entries":[{"title":"Magician (fantasy)","blocks":[{"text":"A magician, also known as a mage, magus, magic-user, spellcaster, enchanter/enchantress, sorcerer/sorceress, warlock, witch, or wizard, is someone who uses or practices magic derived from supernatural, occult, or arcane sources. Magicians enjoy a rich history in mythology, legends, fiction, and folklore, and are common figures in works of fantasy, such as fantasy literature and role-playing games."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/The_Enchanted_Garden_of_Messer_Ansaldo_by_Marie_Spartali_Stillman_%281889%29.jpg/330px-The_Enchanted_Garden_of_Messer_Ansaldo_by_Marie_Spartali_Stillman_%281889%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Magician_(fantasy)","wikidata":"Q148401"},{"title":"Magic (supernatural)","blocks":[{"text":"Magic, sometimes spelled magick, is the application of beliefs, rituals or actions employed with the intent to manipulate natural or supernatural beings and forces. It is a category into which various beliefs and practices have been placed, sometimes considered separate from both religion and science. This separation of the terms 'religion' and 'magic' in a functional sense is disputed. It is a postulate of modern anthropology, at least since early 1930s, that there is complete continuity between magic and religion."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/RWS_Tarot_01_Magician.jpg/330px-RWS_Tarot_01_Magician.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Magic_(supernatural)","wikidata":"Q81741"},{"title":"Wizard (Dungeons & Dragons)","blocks":[{"text":"The wizard, formerly known as the magic-user or mage, is one of the standard character classes in the Dungeons & Dragons fantasy role-playing game. A wizard uses arcane magic, and is considered less effective in melee combat than other classes."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wizard_(Dungeons_%26_Dragons)","wikidata":"Q3843388"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Arthur-Pyle_The_Enchanter_Merlin.JPG/500px-Arthur-Pyle_The_Enchanter_Merlin.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Arthur-Pyle_The_Enchanter_Merlin.JPG/1280px-Arthur-Pyle_The_Enchanter_Merlin.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Arthur-Pyle_The_Enchanter_Merlin.JPG/500px-Arthur-Pyle_The_Enchanter_Merlin.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The Enchanter Merlin, by Howard Pyle, from The Story of King Arthur and His Knights (1903)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AArthur-Pyle_The_Enchanter_Merlin.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8c/Evelyn_De_Morgan_-_The_Love_Potion_%281903%29_-_Google_Cultural_Institute.jpg/500px-Evelyn_De_Morgan_-_The_Love_Potion_%281903%29_-_Google_Cultural_Institute.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8c/Evelyn_De_Morgan_-_The_Love_Potion_%281903%29_-_Google_Cultural_Institute.jpg/1280px-Evelyn_De_Morgan_-_The_Love_Potion_%281903%29_-_Google_Cultural_Institute.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x",